838068815359487e-08\n(0, 1) net: (0.02272449940286067-3.8154361985165683e-19j) expected: 0.022724496 diff: 3.202179937877858e-09\n(1, 0) net: (0.01165681749266503+4.6386062886152553e-10j) expected: 0.011656818 diff: 6.728817954953757e-10\n(1, 1) net: (0.02369966886822091-5.3291076887856487e-11j) expected: 0.02369967 diff: 3.038876642941801e-10\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
